{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關聯同消防處在屯門搗破非法流動加油站。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">執法人員周三傍晚，於龍鼓灘路一帶民居，發現一輛停泊在路邊的七人車，車內裝有汽油塑料儲存缸及入油工具。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FUEL-2130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026TuizpWDPdY1787321624.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FUEL-2130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">行動中共檢獲約370公升未完稅汽油，市值約12,000元，應課稅值為2,200元。人員將涉事車輛及工具檢走，海關正追查來源，不排除稍後有人被捕。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T14:39:20.427959+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}